   1  TIM2+F+I+R3    1.4613  TIM2{2.11318,22.2923,11.5175}+F{0.209788,0.339964,0.238812,0.211436}+I{0.337608}+R3{0.603238,0.990103,0.0569262,6.1123,0.00222729,24.5955}
   2  HKY+F+I+R2     0.7049  HKY{8.19886}+F{0.202434,0.326756,0.214743,0.256067}+I{0.536175}+R2{0.456588,1.71368,0.00723677,30.0623}
   3  TN+F+I+R3      0.9215  TN{18.2487,8.24513}+F{0.237492,0.353786,0.17593,0.232792}+I{0.472904}+R3{0.500859,1.54448,0.024562,7.28903,0.00167529,28.2937}

